        "notes": "The '305 ppm match' is the headline. The closed form Delta m/M_N = hbar_q^2 h [2]_q (1+hbar_q^3)/3 is computed at q_0 and compared to the CODATA n-p split. Since q_0 is itself pinned on nucleon/lepton ratios, an exact-to-305ppm hit of the n-p mass split has some risk of indirect calibration overlap; the block correctly frames this as a conjectural categorical IDENTIFICATION of an already-computed closed form (line 155), not a from-scratch derivation, so not fully circular. Minor."
